/ActualText (Product Designer \(UX/UI\) with 4 years of experience specializing in user-centered design for SaaS, B2B, D2C and e-commerce products, including mobile apps, dashboards, landing pages and AI-powered experiences. I use user research to uncover opportunities and translate insights into wireframes, prototypes and end-to-end UI systems for web and mobile. Experienced in AI-assisted prototyping and usability testing, I deliver scalable, accessible and data-driven digital experiences, collaborating closely with product, engineering and marketing teams to drive continuous improvement through iterative design. I am eager to bring this experience to an ambitious company, helping it scale its impact while we grow together.)
